# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# PatentPulse — environment template
# Copy to .env and adjust. Defaults work for local development.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------

# SQLite database file.
# Relative paths are resolved against the project root at runtime
# (see src/lib/db.ts); absolute paths are used verbatim.
# Local dev default: file:./db/custom.db (created by db:push + db:seed).
# Vercel/serverless: keep file:./db/custom.db — the snapshot baked at build
# time is traced into the function bundle at the same relative path
# (read-only there: the live engine serves fresh data via its in-memory
# overlay; point DATABASE_URL at Turso/Postgres for persistent writes).
DATABASE_URL="file:./db/custom.db"

# Secret key authorizing scheduled cron calls to POST /api/sync.
# Any random string — keep it private. Leave empty to disable cron auth.
SYNC_CRON_KEY="change-me-in-production"

# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# REAL upstream data sources (all free public APIs).
#
# The live engine (src/lib/live.ts) polls these continuously using change
# cursors — data is fetched as it changes, near real time. Without keys it
# falls back to the built-in synthetic generator (demo mode), and every
# record is labeled with its origin (source=courtlistener / uspto-ptab /
# synthetic). Add ANY of the keys below and that source goes live — no code
# changes needed.
#
# 1) CourtListener RECAP API — real US federal patent dockets.
#    Free account: https://www.courtlistener.com/register/
#    Then copy the API token from your profile settings:
#    https://www.courtlistener.com/profile/
#    Docs: https://www.courtlistener.com/api/
#    Refresh: continuous — the engine polls the date_modified change
#    cursor adaptively (hot: 15s, idle: up to 3min) and the RECAP search
#    API for brand-new patent complaints.
COURTLISTENER_TOKEN=""

#    Dedicated PTAB key from the USPTO Open Data Portal
#    (falls back to PATENTSVIEW_API_KEY when empty):
USPTO_PTAB_KEY=""

# 2) USPTO PatentsView / Open Data Portal — patent bibliographic
#    enrichment for asserted patents.
#    Free key: https://data.uspto.gov/apis/getting-started
#    Refresh: weekly bulk bibliographic refresh.
PATENTSVIEW_API_KEY=""

# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Live engine tuning (optional — sensible defaults).
# The engine plans around the free CourtListener token plan
# (5 requests/min · 50/hour · 125/day) with a request-budget ledger
# (caps 4/min · 40/hour · 110/day, leaving headroom for nudges/backfills).
# MIN: poll interval while changes are flowing (ms, floor 15s).
# MAX: poll interval after backing off on a quiet upstream (ms, cap 1h).
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# LIVE_MIN_INTERVAL_MS=60000
# LIVE_MAX_INTERVAL_MS=900000

# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional keep-alive pings for serverless deployments.
# vercel.json schedules a daily keep-warm tick (GET /api/sync/pulse at
# 03:00 UTC) — it only nudges the continuous engine (which still fetches
# strictly on change). To ping it yourself from a crontab / GitHub Action:
#   curl https://your-deployment.vercel.app/api/sync/pulse
# Or force an immediate full check with the admin key:
#   curl -X POST https://your-deployment.vercel.app/api/sync \
#        -H "x-cron-key: $SYNC_CRON_KEY"
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
